  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>- The gravitational force per unit mass exerted on a small point mass placed at that point [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>- Use of Newton's law of gravitation: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F = \\frac{GMm}{r^2}\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g = \\frac{F}{m}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g = \\frac{GM}{r^2}\"></span> [1 mark]<br/>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M = \\frac{2500 \\times (1.5 \\times 10^7)^2}{6.67 \\times 10^{-11} \\times 850} = 9.9 \\times 10^{24} \\text{ kg}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>- Zero / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0 \\text{ J kg}^{-1}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>- Use of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{esc} = \\sqrt{\\frac{2GM}{R}}\"></span> or conservation of energy <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}mv^2 = \\frac{GMm}{R}\"></span> [1 mark]<br/>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{esc} = \\sqrt{\\frac{2 \\times 6.67 \\times 10^{-11} \\times 9.9 \\times 10^{24}}{7.2 \\times 10^6}} = 1.4 \\times 10^4 \\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section>"
